s de types d'échantillons environnementaux. Remplace la page commune de revue assurance qualité, conservée sous 1708490791."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "fe122ce33c8b"}, "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "0fe0f4f546e4"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "ce8c8ffd7b40"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Testé"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "6505e54fb187"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "7fa3fa15067f"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Demande environnementale DEV01260000000000026 : six éléments de la liste de contrôle cochés Réussi, Accepter l'échantillon (Conditions d'éligibilité de Pending à Accepté), Soumettre (Demande soumise avec succès, Prêt pour analyse)."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "07b8502d4fc7"}, "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "bbce443d3c2d"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "942c4a558265"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Observé, non testé"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "1eccb0459d19"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "dfa88ffc9c4a"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Réponses Échec et N/A, Signaler un ENC, Rééchantillonner, Détails de la demande, et le parcours vectoriel."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "8de2fec386ed"}, "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "ca498ddaffa9"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "5b79d98b7d84"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Statut"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "5c6acc694526"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "a42616e157ae"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Travail en cours, revue OGC-1301."}]}]}]}]}], "ver